{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "4ff88bf7-7176-8496-80ee-16ac2aa245bf",
  "created_at": "2026-02-23T14:20:22-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Mei Cohen",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:16:10-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. Good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:16:14-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good afternoon. I'm calling about a sidewalk, really. It's heaved up pretty bad and I tripped on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:16:23-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, sorry to hear that. Are you okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:16:28-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm fine, just a scraped hand. I'd just like to get it on somebody's list before someone else goes down on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:16:39-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure thing. Let me grab a few details. Where is the sidewalk?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:16:45-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's at 266 Chapel Street, up the Hill. Right out front of the house, on the sidewalk side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:16:54-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two sixty-six Chapel. Okay. And what's it look like? Is it a slab that's lifted?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:17:02-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, one slab has pushed up at the edge, so there's a lip. The whole raised section is about two feet across."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:17:13-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two feet across, lifted edge. Got it. Any idea what caused it? Tree roots, frost?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:17:21-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd guess the roots from the maple there, plus the freeze and thaw. It was like this a little before, but it seems worse since the nor'easter last weekend, Saturday into Sunday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:17:36-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that'll do it. All that water and then freezing overnight. I'm putting down that it's worse after the storm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:17:46-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. And I'd like the street added to the repair list, if there's a list. Chapel Street, I mean, that stretch."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:17:57-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There is, we keep a running list. I'll add this location and note the trip. I can't tell you when a crew gets to it, since they've got storm cleanup backed up right now, but it'll be in the queue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:18:16-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. I just want it written down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:18:20-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It will be. Is the lip sharp enough that I should flag it as a hazard? Like, is it something people would catch a toe on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:18:33-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Definitely a toe-catcher. About an inch and a half up at the worst spot, I'd say. I caught mine right on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:18:44-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, hazard noted. Can I get a callback number in case the inspector has questions?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:18:52-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0187."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:18:54-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Five-five-five, zero-one-eight-seven, with the 401. And the name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:18:58-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mei Cohen. C-O-H-E-N."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:19:00-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Mei. Sorry, one sec, I'm just typing this in. [pause] Okay. Anything else on that block you've noticed? Potholes, anything like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:19:11-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not on my end of it. Just the sidewalk. Oh, and while I've got you, this is unrelated, but the school calendar app keeps sending me duplicate reminders. Is that something you folks handle?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:19:27-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that wouldn't be us. That'd be the school department or whoever runs the app. They'd have to sort that out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:19:37-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I figured. I'll try them. Just thought I'd ask since I had somebody on the phone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:19:46-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Their main office should be able to point you in the right direction."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:19:54-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. So the sidewalk's logged, two sixty-six Chapel, two feet across, and on the list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:20:02-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it exactly. You'll be in the queue, and if the inspector needs more they'll call you at that number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:20:12-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. Thank you, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:20:15-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care of that hand."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:20:19-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Bye now."
    }
  ],
